1. GOOGLE GEMMA OPEN-WEIGHT MODELS NOTICE
================================================================================
Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

LifeVault includes optional on-device integration bridges (`LifeVaultGemmaChannel`
and `LifeVaultLlmChannel`) for Google Gemma open-weight models, including:
  - Gemma 3n E4B IT / Gemma 3n E2B IT (`.litertlm` / `.task` format)
  - Gemma 2 2B IT (`gemma-2b-it` / `gemma-2-2b-it` `.gguf` format)

Gemma model weights are governed by the Google Gemma Terms of Use
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms) and the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy), NOT the Apache License 2.0.
Raw Gemma model weight binaries are not committed to this Git repository or
bundled in the base APK; users provision legitimately obtained model artifacts
locally on-device.

